; 43b: BIND is the primary, rdnsd replicates. The EXPIRE is 45 seconds so the
; branch CLAUDE.md §4 calls out — a zone out of contact with every master is
; withdrawn, not served stale — is reachable inside a test run rather than in a
; week.
$ORIGIN frombind.test.
$TTL 300
@   IN SOA ns1.frombind.test. hostmaster.frombind.test. ( 1 10 5 45 60 )
@   IN NS  ns1.frombind.test.
ns1 IN A   10.53.0.7
www IN A   198.51.100.10
mail IN A  198.51.100.25
